    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A sense of ancient, predatory focus settles over the one who draws this string. It is a relic of a lost age, capable of striking with a force that defies the limits of wood and sinew. Its reach finds every hidden mark with lethal precision.",
